WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.357
If a tool seems to be missing,

2
00:00:02.357 --> 00:00:06.400
slash doctor can tell you what
pi sees in the current session.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.170
The report lists the installed
versions and tool registry.

4
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:14.940
Here it finds deferred tools,
but tool search is inactive.

5
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.840
That gives you something specific
to check in your settings.

6
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:29.073
You can use the report to guide the fix.

7
00:00:29.073 --> 00:00:32.793
It reads the session and
configuration without changing them.
